  (text "Boost8.04V; D3 blocks any Nano VIN voltage from feeding the boost capacitors or converter.\nNano USB powers its5V rail through Nano D2, separately from the VIN buck input.\nJP1 disconnects external VIN feed only. USB load/rail voltage and transfer continuity need bench acceptance."
